<!-- 105 dining room. The Jill and Chris variants number their AOT slots
     differently (the room script sets each branch's own table), so every
     fact here names its character.

     Jill. Once the wood emblem is off the fireplace (common 0xAA clear), the
     fireplace's SCE_USEITEM probe AOT 11 arms the gold emblem. USE it there:
     the room sets common 0xAB and moves the sideboard off the shield key.

     Until common 0xA1 is set, every entry spawns Barry at (4300,8000), the
     fireplace's front, where he stands over the blood (and skipping his
     first scene leaves him there at once). The wood emblem pickup (AOT 7)
     cannot be reached past him. Room init sets 0xA1 on the first entry after
     common 0x02 (Barry has left the dining room), and Barry no longer spawns;
     the gate then lifts and the planner takes the emblem.

     The story waits on Barry's conversation at the fireplace: once he
     stands there, the room arms walk-in zones AOT 2 (south of the table)
     and AOT 3, and walking into either plays it; it ends by setting common
     0xA2. Skipping his first scene sets 0xA2 as well. Until then the east
     door stays shut, so the conversation is a step, not a side effect of
     walking to the emblem.

     Back from 104 (common 0xAC set, 0xAD clear), Barry shoots the zombie
     (event on_enter_2, which sets 0xAD at its end). Let it play: a skipped
     run of it left Barry's legs in the floor while his upper body moved (a
     player report; headless, the skipped and the watched scene end with the
     same actor state). Watching it costs about 900 ticks once.

     AOT 13 (Jill) and AOT 10 (Chris) are the fireplace hollow's "an emblem
     was in" message, not a passage: a passage check there only reads it.

     Chris. No Barry: commons 0xA0-0xA2 are never read here. 106 sets common
     0xA7 on Chris's first entry (the wood emblem is on the fireplace, AOT 4;
     taking it clears 0xA7). The east door is shut while common 0x01 is set
     and 0x02 clear (AOT 2 shows "There may be more here"); 104's zombie
     film sets 0x02. With the wood emblem off, the fireplace's USEITEM AOT 8
     takes the gold emblem and the room sets common 0xA8 and moves the
     sideboard off the shield key (AOT 3). -->
<bot format="2">
  <interact slot="3" bank="1" bit="0xA2" character="jill" label="walk up to Barry at the fireplace"/>
  <use slot="11" item="0x20" bank="1" bit="0xAB" character="jill" label="gold emblem in the fireplace"/>
  <use slot="8" item="0x20" bank="1" bit="0xA8" character="chris" label="gold emblem in the fireplace"/>
  <avoid slot="7" bank="1" bit="0xA1" while="clear" character="jill"
         reason="Barry stands in front of the fireplace until common 0xA1 is set"/>
  <avoid slot="13" character="jill" reason="the fireplace hollow's message, not a passage"/>
  <avoid slot="10" character="chris" reason="the fireplace hollow's message, not a passage"/>
  <watch bank="1" bit="0xAD" after_bank="1" after_bit="0xAC" character="jill"
         label="Barry shoots the zombie"/>
</bot>
